X:49
T:Rowland Hornpipe
A:Lancashire - Wyresdale
B:A John Winder Book, April 1789
L:1/8
M:C|
N:A personal note - this was the first 3/2 hornpipe I ever met; written like this, in 4/4. It took me years to realise what was going on with it ...
O:England
Z:Richard Robinson <URL:http://www.qualmograph.org.uk/contact.html>
